@startuml
title PayLink - Payment Life Cycle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #444444
}
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 45

[*] --> Initiated : payment request received

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass\nand wallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails\nor insufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within\n10 s timeout

Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms\n(callback, retry, settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses, or\nreconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : hold released\nto wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

state Initiated : no money moved yet
state FundsHeld : amount + fee moved\nto held balance
state Completed : FINAL\nhold captured, fee income credited,\nagent commission recorded
state Rejected : FINAL\nno hold was created
state Refunded : FINAL
state Unknown : money stays held\nnever refunded automatically\nre-queried at 1, 5, 15 min,\nthen waits for reconciliation

@enduml